// 5:3, 600 by 360. Six bars of 60. The canton is 240 by 180, which is 2/5 of the fly and half the hoist.
// Each ring is 40 in radius with a 10.5 stroke: outer 45.25, inner 34.75. Each stem is 10.5 by 48, and each bar 43 by 10.5.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Lesbian Pride Flag, Double-Venus Canton Rainbow"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  source "https://web.archive.org/web/20240625090826/https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/qq-rb_v2.html"
  source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lesbian_flags"
  source "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lesbian_Pride_double-Venus_canton_rainbow_flag.svg"
  note "This is a rainbow flag with a canton added, not a flag with a designer. Flags of the World (page of 21 September 2023, Wayback Machine 25 June 2024) says flags with a white double-Venus symbol on a blue canton, much darker than the blue stripe, were seen in Zurich on 6 June 2009, in Santa Fe in February 2010, in London on 3 July 2010 and in Nottingham on 31 July 2010, with the two Venus symbols conjoined. Wikipedia says lesbians were using such flags by 2009."
  note "No source read names a designer, a date of origin or a construction, or gives color values. The six bars (red, orange, yellow, green, blue, violet) are the rainbow flag with six stripes. The bar colors, the canton's #291c6c, its size and the symbol's measurements all follow the Commons drawing."
  note "The Commons drawing's bar colors are its own: #e40303, #ff8c00, #ffed00, #008026, #2f93da and #750787. Its blue differs from the indigo of other six-stripe rainbow drawings, such as the Progress flag's #004dff, and no source read says which is right."
  note "The double-Venus symbol is two rings with a stem and a crossbar under each, drawn here with rings and rectangles from the Commons drawing's circles and lines, because it is a geometric figure. The Unicode symbol is U+26A2."
}
palette {
  red "#e40303"
  orange "#ff8c00"
  yellow "#ffed00"
  green "#008026"
  blue "#2f93da"
  violet "#750787"
  navy "#291c6c"
  white "#ffffff"
}
proportion hoist=360 fly=600

bars red orange yellow green blue violet

canton {
  fly 240
  hoist 180
  field navy
  charge ring white {
    radius 45.25
    inner 34.75
    at fly=91 hoist=71
    at fly=149 hoist=71
  }
  charge rect white {
    fly 10.5
    hoist 48
    at fly=91 hoist=135
    at fly=149 hoist=135
  }
  charge rect white {
    fly 43
    hoist 10.5
    at fly=91 hoist=137.5
    at fly=149 hoist=137.5
  }
}
